WEBVTT

00:00:00.720 --> 00:00:02.820
The notes say it needs more salt.

00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:04.220
The notes are wrong.

00:00:04.580 --> 00:00:05.360
It needs more chicken.

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:07.420
Every recipe doesn’t need more chicken.

00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:09.380
Every recipe needs more chicken.
